<title>USA: U.S. Energy Systems FY 97 net loss widens.</title>
<headline>U.S. Energy Systems FY 97 net loss widens.</headline>
<dateline>WEST PALM BEACH, Fla. 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year Ended January 31,</p>
<p>					 1997	    1996</p>
<p>(000's omitted)</p>
<p> Revenues:			   $266		--</p>
<p> Loss from joint ventures	 163		17</p>
<p>Net (loss) before extraordinary</p>
<p>  items			   (2,023)	 (1,474)</p>
<p>Extraordinary gain (loss)</p>
<p>from liability</p>
<p>  restructuring			25		83</p>
