<p> Net (loss) per share	  (2.58)	  (3.28)</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>  shares outstanding	1,037,239	 438,773</p>
<p>NOTE:  U.S. Energy Systems Inc said its fiscal year ended on January 31.</p>
<p>Net income was calculated before the payment of preferred dividends, earnings per share were calculated after the payment of preferred dividends.</p>
<p>The company said that net loss for the first quarter of 1997 was affected by a one-time accounting charge for the fair value of common shares issued in connection with the conversion of dividend bearing preferred shares.</p>
<p>The company also said it completed its initial public offering in December 1996.</p>
